  "description": "We are celebrating 60 years of ZEG with a trail bike that is unrivalled in terms of price and performance. The Copperhead EVO AM 2 is based on a sophisticated carbon frame with innovative 4-link swingarm rear suspension for the best possible performance on trails. Combining RockShox suspension with 150 mm travel, the power of the Bosch Performance Line CX drive and high-quality Shimano Deore XT components with 12-speed gears, our anniversary model ticks all the boxes. Add to that smart details and highlights such as the cornering light in the head tube and the MonkeyLink Twinlights integrated into the dropouts, and you've got everything you need in terms of lighting. The rest is pure riding pleasure on every metre of trail.",
